OL,5,G0020 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,6,     FDouglas to Port Erin: Michael
OL,7,     FPortillo returns to travel by
OL,8,     Ftrain to more places around the
OL,9,     FBritish Isles, beginning by
OL,10,     Fheading to the Isle of Man - a
OL,11,     Fparadise for rail lovers.
OL,12,G0050 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FLiverpool to Blackpool: Michael
OL,14,     FPortillo journeys to Liverpool's
OL,15,     Fhistoric waterfront, where he
OL,16,     Fvisits the International Slavery
OL,17,     FMuseum, before heading north
OL,18,     Ftowards Blackpool.
